  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-15T23:54:58.893Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently there are only three options on displaying a user's avatar. Show avatar fully, hide avatar, show avatar via shield/safety.\n\nThe user can set a binary switch on whether they show their impostor over their fallback. Personally, I am okay with either choice when it comes to my avatar, and I would like the person looking at me decide what is right for them.\n\nI feel like the available options should be:\n\n-Show avatar fully\n\n-Show avatar with shield/safety\n\n-Show fallback\n\n-Show impostor (if applicable)\n\n-Hide avatar",
